{"v":4,"catch":"瀟瀟細雨，隆隆煙火，少年遇見了少女。\n只屬於二人的夏日，停滯的過去再次轉動。","desc":"失去過去的少年，於升。回到舊日的小鎮，尋找遺忘的“某件東西”，卻對名為亦遙的少女一見鍾情。\n夏日的祭典上，他羞澀告白，她微微點頭，然而一晚之後，亦遙已然忘記了關於自己的一切。\n在記憶的回廊里徘徊的他，能夠找到真相嗎？\n\n+ 八萬字懸疑視覺小説\n+ 精心設計的演出效果\n+ 原創音樂&全程語音","publisher":"Navila Software Japan","release":"2021-07-08","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fd7d4fb01ad19a23b93611d212876be5c8e1253362c458da81cf038efdddd9dc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b90975703371a3068217a9689c3cc7df22fd7ca63a3388db1c9bf501e5f719db.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8203a3b1a51c3ce502fec60fa9ddd5fde74bc4cd2e27db53792bb49bfda1d35.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5a01aa08cd57a60487d449ee2655fb4d2c1a12856c76d0469371ce093a00818.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/68f9c01e63e045021939587e3f4d0e16450ea1baadf2ea43793ecbb606581713.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0272fbd32e106be29b909439156a418791b3110da56eb50838591d0dc1e6cd87.jpg"],"titleId":"01003a6015316000","dlc":[]}